# Security and diagnostics profile inspired by Kali's tool categories.
# These packages come from Debian repositories; ShreeOS intentionally does not
# mix Kali repositories into Debian stable. Tools unavailable in Debian stable
# should later be packaged in a ShreeOS-owned repository rather than importing
# Kali repositories into the base system.
nmap
wireshark
tshark
tcpdump
netcat-openbsd
socat
aircrack-ng
john
hashcat
hydra
sqlmap
gobuster
dirb
masscan
binwalk
foremost
sleuthkit
testdisk
yara
gdb
strace
ltrace
dnsutils
whois
traceroute
net-tools
iproute2
iputils-ping
